 "ambiguities": [
  "lg_role: league mean over rows with same role and date strictly before; rows with NaN x skipped; implemented via per-date cumulative sums.",
  "Shrinkage columns (heavy38_shr, p35_shr, fb_*_shr) are NaN whenever the rate or lg_role is NaN (no fallback).",
  "heavy38_rate_pre uses all earlier rows (up to 80) when 5<=games_pre<80, weights renormalised over available rows.",
  "p35_pre requires 10 earlier rows; n35_pre/heavy38_n_pre NaN only for first row (n35 via expanding sum min_periods=1).",
  "season_max_pts_pre uses expanding max over earlier rows within (player, season_n).",
  "tail: cm sums non-NaN minutes; ppm NaN when no earlier rows or cm<=0; ex_k NaN where base False or m_g NaN.",
  "per-36: ewm sum via pandas shift(1).ewm(adjust=True).sum() ignoring NaN minutes; den NaN only at first row; lgm uses rows with minutes>0.",
  "tm_abs: rank ties by ascending player index via lexsort; k skipped if fewer than k players or tot<=0; first-game f0 computed over all club games.",
  "tm_abs: club games with NaN-minutes players: M NaN for NaN minutes (player has row but minutes NaN) treated as NaN (absent).",
  "first basket: fb_team matched by (game_id, shooter id) to first made FG of either is_home side; shooter id cast to float; ordering sort ascending sequence ties stable.",
  "fb_* is NaN for games not in shots (regular, is_shooting_play True); fb flag 0.0 otherwise.",
  "usage_share_pre is shifted-ewm of usg_share (per-player ewm convention).",
  "early: e_att/e_made 0.0 for missing (game,sid) when game in shots; team totals via sum(min_count=1) so NaN if game not in shots; early_made_share requires stm>0.",
  "early_usg_share_pre propagates NaN if usage_share_pre NaN (no fallback).",
  "universe key: team_id (tm) used for club grouping; shot_events team_id not used (is_home used instead)."
 ]
